  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "大數據概念與應用實習",
    "sub_ename": "EXERCISE OF PRINCIPLE AND APPLICATION OF BIG DATA",
    "describe_ch": "本課程擬以「大數據分析應用」為教學特色，藉由實習課程，強化學生實作能力並培育職場即戰力。依此發展目標，將強化大數據分析軟體應用及實務操作，並融入土地管理。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed with a focus on \"Big Data Analytics Applications,\" aiming to enhance students' practical skills and cultivate their readiness for the workplace through internship opportunities. In line with these development goals, we will strengthen the application of big data analytics software and practical operations, incorporating them into land management practices.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 0.0
